<a:Comment>Restricciones CHECK de la base (2): candidate_profiles_education_valid, candidate_profiles_experience_range. El importador PostgreSQL 9.x conserva una sola por tabla; aqui se restituye su conjuncion (AND), que es equivalente.</a:Comment>
<a:ServerCheckExpression>(((education_level IS NULL) OR ((education_level)::text = ANY ((ARRAY[&#39;secundaria&#39;::character varying, &#39;tecnico&#39;::character varying, &#39;bachiller&#39;::character varying, &#39;titulado&#39;::character varying, &#39;maestria&#39;::character varying, &#39;doctorado&#39;::character varying])::text[]))))
AND (((years_of_experience IS NULL) OR ((years_of_experience &gt;= 0) AND (years_of_experience &lt;= 60))))</a:ServerCheckExpression>
<a:CheckConstraintName>candidate_profiles_education_valid</a:CheckConstraintName>
