<a:Comment>Restricciones CHECK de la base (5): evaluations_completion_consistent, evaluations_duration_range, evaluations_modality_valid, evaluations_status_valid, evaluations_type_valid. El importador PostgreSQL 9.x conserva una sola por tabla; aqui se restituye su conjuncion (AND), que es equivalente.</a:Comment>
<a:ServerCheckExpression>((((status)::text = &#39;realizada&#39;::text) = (completed_at IS NOT NULL)))
AND (((duration_minutes IS NULL) OR ((duration_minutes &gt;= 15) AND (duration_minutes &lt;= 480))))
AND (((modality)::text = ANY ((ARRAY[&#39;presencial&#39;::character varying, &#39;virtual&#39;::character varying])::text[])))
AND (((status)::text = ANY ((ARRAY[&#39;programada&#39;::character varying, &#39;realizada&#39;::character varying])::text[])))
AND (((type)::text = ANY ((ARRAY[&#39;conocimientos&#39;::character varying, &#39;clase_modelo&#39;::character varying, &#39;practica&#39;::character varying, &#39;otra&#39;::character varying])::text[])))</a:ServerCheckExpression>
<a:CheckConstraintName>evaluations_completion_consistent</a:CheckConstraintName>
