<a:ModificationDate>1790218316</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>user</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Restricciones CHECK de la base (5): vacancies_closure_consistent, vacancies_dates_consistent, vacancies_positions_positive, vacancies_status_valid, vacancies_target_after_close. El importador PostgreSQL 9.x conserva una sola por tabla; aqui se restituye su conjuncion (AND), que es equivalente.</a:Comment>
<a:ServerCheckExpression>(((((status)::text = &#39;cerrada&#39;::text) AND (closed_at IS NOT NULL) AND ((closure_type)::text = ANY ((ARRAY[&#39;con_seleccion&#39;::character varying, &#39;desierta&#39;::character varying])::text[]))) OR (((status)::text &lt;&gt; &#39;cerrada&#39;::text) AND (closure_type IS NULL))))
AND (((opens_at IS NULL) OR (closes_at IS NULL) OR (closes_at &gt;= opens_at)))
AND ((positions &gt;= 1))
AND (((status)::text = ANY ((ARRAY[&#39;borrador&#39;::character varying, &#39;publicada&#39;::character varying, &#39;cerrada&#39;::character varying])::text[])))
AND (((target_completion_at IS NULL) OR (closes_at IS NULL) OR (target_completion_at &gt; closes_at)))</a:ServerCheckExpression>
<a:CheckConstraintName>vacancies_closure_consistent</a:CheckConstraintName>
<a:TotalSavingCurrency/>
<c:AttachedRules>
